  "body_html": "<h1>Proof Plan for Orbit Intertwining</h1>\n<ol>\n<li>Split the datum into the highest-depth block and the remaining direct sum.</li>\n<li>Decompose the oscillator residual space into block-diagonal and off-diagonal parts.</li>\n<li>Use Lemma 8.5 to identify the off-diagonal oscillator factor with the off-diagonal Heisenberg-Weil representation.</li>\n<li>Use Lemma 8.6 to factor the stabilizer representation.</li>\n<li>Apply Frobenius reciprocity to reduce the Hom space to the product of the top-block Hom space and the lower-block Hom space.</li>\n<li>Use Proposition 7.1 for the top block and the induction hypothesis for the lower blocks.</li>\n</ol>",
